[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on the ramp.</p><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2584356\">1048A32</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p>Raise the car on the lift</p><p>1. Open clamps (1a) and disconnect oil vapour separator pipe (1b),\nthen lower the car.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021217.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Open retaining band (1a) on the air intake chamber  and remove\nidle oil vapour intake pipe (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021218.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the  idle oil vapour inlet pipe back\nin its housing and secure it using the bands.</p><p>Raise the lift and secure the pipe to the\nengine oil filler fitting with a band.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584356\">1048A32</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]